WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.070 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Okay, okay — new idea. Hear me out. Um…
no, wait. This one's actually big.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.630 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>So… did we make it?

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:09.890 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Read it.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.500 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>It's blank.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.080 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>We don't write things down. We talk. Voice
notes, all day, every idea.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.800 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>What happened to that guy?

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.270 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>I don't know how it ends yet.

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:22.170 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Then don't write it. Say it.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.800 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Okay. Did we build anything?

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.230 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Three things.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.570 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Three companies?

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.110 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Three products. Calm down.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.770 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>…Okay. First one.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:38.410 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Friends were throwing around a hackathon
idea. I shipped it in four, five hours.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:44.300 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Two, three days later I'd bought a domain
— didn't even know how domains worked.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:48.230 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Ten emails. One reply.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:49.560 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>One reply!

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:55.400 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Wrong customers. Small sites didn't feel
the pain. Big ones already had someone.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:56.280 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Second?

00:00:56.320 --> 00:01:01.270 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Spending limits for AI apps. Nobody cared
about the bill yet.

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.100 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Third?

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:07.770 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Safety rules for AI agents. Five months.
Best thing I've ever built.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:11.825 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>You sleep at twelve, right? I was up till
three. Every night.

00:01:11.865 --> 00:01:13.620 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Code, customers, emails.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.210 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>So who's using it?

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:20.010 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Fifty emails. Zero replies.

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:22.450 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Did you try—

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:28.222 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Articles. Reddit. One post blew up in a
few hours. Mods took it down.

00:01:28.262 --> 00:01:29.860 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Account too new.

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.590 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>…Of course they did.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:33.310 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Money?

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:34.580 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Zero.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:40.970 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>I'd promised myself five thousand dollars
a month. By December.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:46.285 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Placements are next July. Half of me is
preparing for that. Half of me is here.

00:01:46.325 --> 00:01:47.460 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Never all in.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.900 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>So two months ago, I stopped. Everything.

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:55.700 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Was I wrong? To want it that big?

00:01:55.750 --> 00:02:03.090 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>No. You're the only reason I started. You
just didn't know how long the middle is.

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:08.191 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>I kept asking AI for ideas. But real
problems don't come from prompts.

00:02:08.231 --> 00:02:13.520 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>They come from people. And I've been doing
it all alone, in one room.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:14.890 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>So what's next?

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:18.884 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Get out of this room. Talk to people.
Maybe physical AI.

00:02:18.924 --> 00:02:21.200 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Honestly, I don't know yet.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.400 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>It's okay.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.350 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>…What?

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:25.150 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>It's okay. You'll do it.

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:26.550 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>How do you know?

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:28.520 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>You're still talking to me.

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:33.400 line:85%
<v First-year Sky>Don't write it. Say it.

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:37.010 line:85%
<v Third-year Sky>Okay. New idea. Hear me out.
